<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $42-7/8 (FIM 194.32).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $42-7/8 (FIM 194.32).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADS closed down $0-1/4 at $42-7/8 in New York on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 194.32 markka. In Helsinki on Wednesday, Nokia closed down four markka at 193.50.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADS (two shares) closed flat at $32-3/4 on Wall Street. The price equals about 74.23 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed 0.40 lower at 74.50.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADS ended flat at $21 in New York (95.18 markka). Rauma closed also unchanged in Helsinki, at 95.50 markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
